!Logfest 2006

There was a ((jbonunsla 2006)) at Penguicon 2006, and there one will take place at Philcon 2006 as well. See the page on ((jbonunsla 2006)) for the planning document.

^ "Penguicon, a combination science fiction convention and open source software expo in the greater Detroit metro area of Michigan, has allocated function space for Logfest 2006. In its fourth year, Penguicon is held April 21 through 23, 2006 at the Holiday Inn in Livonia, Michigan. See [http://www.penguicon.org/|http://www.penguicon.org/] and [http://wiki.penguicon.org/|http://wiki.penguicon.org/] for more information about Penguicon.

My presentation about Lojban at Penguicon 2005 packed the room, and is in demand for a repeat this year. There are at least four local Detroit-area jbopre who will be in attendance at Logfest 2006 activities, and probably more like seven. Please join us, and it will be very well attended! LogFest will be held in the Brewstreet Dining Area, which can be seen in photos on the hotel website at [http://www.ichotelsgroup.com/h/d/hi/1/en/hpt/DTTLN/2/pt?ptLink=hd|http://www.ichotelsgroup.com/h/d/hi/1/en/hpt/DTTLN/2/pt?ptLink=hd]" ^